// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable Group - depends_on_Person Var Name - INTRODUCTION_STRING 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P60547619" "That's a coded message from your Broker. Some guy named Richard Ellsworth has been selling secrets to the {VillainGroup}, and there's a reward on his head."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3146501323" "The {VillainGroup} have a new friend known only as 'Dizzy'. An interview in the paper claims she has visions of the future. Arachnos would likely pay a hefty bounty if you were to bring her to them."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1783082010" "The {VillainGroup} are hiding someone. A man by the name of Alan Carter. It's said he knows a rare spell that certain contacts of yours might find interesting."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3689364743" "A guy named RJ Nelson is snitching to Longbow. He's paid the {VillainGroup} to protect him, and those losers agreed. That stuffs has gotta stop."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1898254491" "A little witch named {PERSON_NAME} stole some kind of rare magical powder from a certain mage in Cap au Diable and then hired the {VillainGroup} to protect her."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P668489253" "Edward Juarez is known in the underground as the 'Efficiency Expert of Evil.' He has no superpowers, but is known for drastically improving the effectiveness of criminal gangs. His advice could turn the {VillainGroup} into a real problem. Unless of course you kidnap Jaurez for yourself."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1060704109" "Someone has been casting spells against Arachnos Arbiters. As you know, this is is strictly forbidden. A coded ad by one of your contacts in the Rogue Isle Protector says an amateur magician named 'Steffan the Magnificent' is responsible. The {VillainGroup} have him now. It wouldn't take you long to take this wizard wannabe from those jerks and collect his bounty for yourself."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2158187092" "You got sloppy on your last job. Some geek was up late in the apartment next door playing online games all night. He saw what you did and ratted you out to Arachnos. The {VillainGroup} have him now and are trying to find out where you are. A quick trip to their local hideout should net you the snitch and reveal why these jerks are so interested in you."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P35543946" "Elizabeth Gordon is the Gal Friday of a certain superhero who won't stay outta the Rogue Isles. The {VillainGroup} have her now, but you could easily take her for yourself and ransom her off."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2003916148" "Those idiots the {VillainGroup} grabbed some random folks off the street recently. One of them happened to be the brother of Silver Mantis, Black Scorpion's squeeze. She wants him back."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2673697364" "A stoolie by the name of Luke Wilson has been squealing to Longbow. The {VillainGroup} got him first. Nab him and the reward should be quite large."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3748064960" "Camille Henri is tied to the Luddites. You've heard rumors she's the sister of their leader, Martin Henri himself. The {VillainGroup} have her now, but if you took her from them you could sell her to the Luddites' enemies."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2545519835" "A secretary named Jesse Montoya just inherited a minor artifact long thought missing. The {VillainGroup} moved in quick and kidnapped her last night, but you have a pretty good idea where they likely took her."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2612231738" "Several organizations made the mistake of trusting an attorney named Norman Washburn with their information. He's kept his bargain with the law, but seems to be selling secrets to his clients' rivals. This must not go unpunished. A coded ad in the paper reveals that the {VillainGroup} have him, and where they're located."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1380483404" "Emma Jean Turley bought a small trinket at a pawn shop on Mercy Isle. Turns out this trinket has some powerful juju. She's been trying to sell it in the classifieds, but it looks like the {VillainGroup} got to her first."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2243168157" "Larry Croft is a backup guitarist for Johnny Sonata in St. Martial. He went missing two days ago, which explains the weird music you've heard coming from a local {VillainGroup} hideout. Rescuing this loser would probably win you some points with Arachnos."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1860516797" "Nigel Whitley is a famous occult novelist. He's not dead though. A friend of yours said he saw him being taken into one of the {VillainGroup}'s hideouts the night of the crash. Whatever they want him for ought to be juicy."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3641397263" "What the? This is bad. Someone's grabbed an Arbiter and made it look like you did it. It's not that you're afraid of the spiders, just that, well, you'd rather they not interfere in your plans right now--by going back in time and wiping out your entire genetic history. You'd better find this loser and fast."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1518026345" "Frank Gordon was doing an expose on you, but you didn't kill him. More likely one of your enemies grabbed him to find out everything he'd learned about you. And that really ticks you off. You'd best find Gordon and teach whoever took him that they messed with the wrong supervillain."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1400523240" "Milton Ives was the last person to have touched the Blood Ruby, a gem said to curse whoever holds it. The {VillainGroup} have taken him to find out what he knows. You'd like to do the same."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2089311012" "The article says the {VillainGroup} have it in for you. No surprise there. But they've forced a girl with psychic powers to find you and give you some sort of mental whammy. You'd best get this girl out of their clutches quick. Then maybe see what she can do for you."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3336884430" "Gav Turner was a prison guard at the Zig. Last night he was murdered by the {VillainGroup}. That doesn't surprise you, but they took his daughter too. Why? Revenge? You have a hunch you should find out. Maybe she knows something."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2599131733" "The {VillainGroup} have agreed to protect a witness to a recent crime committed by Captain Mako. Your friends tell you the spiders will deposit a sizeable chunk of change in your account if you can recover the witness and end this inconvenience."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3915311515" "It's nice to make the news, but Jake Limes, reporter for WSPDR, is getting on your nerves. He's making up lies about you and must be taught a lesson. The {VillainGroup} must be mad at him too because your sources say they've already jacked him off the street. That's fine. It gives you more skulls to bust."

