"P1387023740" "This {PERSON_NAME} should be around here somewhere."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P593109706" "What a dump. No wonder {PERSON_NAME} is hiding."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P3721987910" "Did {VillainGroup} really think they could hide {PERSON_NAME} in this hole?"
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P258786955" "The long walk to this dump has made you angry. Most folks don't like you when you're angry. Most folks don't like you when you're happy either."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P4211196640" "{PERSON_NAME} must be really desperate to hole up in a dive like this."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P3602817947" "Here you are. How lucky {VillainGroup} is to get beaten to a pulp by the likes of you."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P2440523812" "You're {VillainName}. You're big. You're bad. And you're here."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P1422953908" "What's really angry and just walked in the front door? {VillainName}."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P2456586153" "'Anybody home? It's the freakin' Avon Lady. Come get some samples.'"
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P1966301336" "Oh yeah. This is gonna be fun."
// Script Variable SAYONRESCUE_STRING :
"P143938097" "Oh shoot."
// Script Variable SAYONRESCUE_STRING :
"P660085104" "Hey look, {VillainName}. This is all just a big misunderstanding, okay?"
// Script Variable SAYONRESCUE_STRING :
"P575211625" "I didn't say anything! Can't you just let me go?"
// Script Variable SAYONRESCUE_STRING :
"P2250046251" "If you let me go I'll make it worth your while!"
// Script Variable SAYONRESCUE_STRING :
"P2410324826" "Please don't do this. I've got kids. Well, not really, but I'd like to some day."
// Script Variable SAYONRESCUE_STRING :
"P1347029990" "So, what would it take for you to forget about all this?"
// Script Variable SAYONRESCUE_STRING :
"P2788122703" "I know people. You'll regret this, {VillainName}."
// Script Variable SAYONRESCUE_STRING :
"P3706294296" "I don't know what you've heard, but I'm not who you think I am. {PERSON_NAME}? Oh. Guess I am then."
// Script Variable SAYONRESCUE_STRING :
"P2004722537" "So, what now?"
// Script Variable SAYONRESCUE_STRING :
"P561250241" "Look, let's work something out. You're a reasonable--well, let's work something out anyway."
// Script Variable SAYONRESCUE_STRING :
"P429129193" "My uncle works for Arachnos. Kill me and you'll regret it."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P162226317" "I'm coming. Keep your tights on."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P2873508037" "Sorry! Sorry! Coming!"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P1258052142" "I wasn't going anywhere, promise!"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P1224721445" "On my way. Sorry. Please don't hurt me!"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P3668046898" "Yup. Right here. Sorry. This wall jumped in front of me. Heh."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P326435614" "What? I'm coming. Just checking out this--thing, here."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P253134344" "Come on, {VillainName}. You don't really wanna do this, do you?"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P123769912" "Coming. Coming. Tripped on something."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P3124868844" "Oh, my back. I don't think I can walk any--okay--sorry. Coming."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P893804668" "Can--we--just--rest for a minute?"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P3935262424" "What? My cell phone? Okay--here. Sorry. I won't try that again, {VillainName}."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P49765460" "I got family that'll pay good money if you keep me alive."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P2872982137" "Lemme outta here!"
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P2301215775" "Where to now?"
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P2253885502" "Can we talk about this?"
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P990261599" "How much to say you never found me?"
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P3487791079" "Can't we all just get along?"
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P1743078779" "I'm going! I'm going!"
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P3780660724" "All right, {VillainName}. You got me. No need to get rough."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P986182295" "See you on the other side. Not!"
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P2887999466" "Through here? Okay."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P2388486583" "I'm going. Cool your jets, {VillainName}."

